            <center><strong><u>Public Notice</u></strong></center>
            
            A public notice was published on the SET Department's website on July 7, 2026. In the said notice, the tentative date for the 41st SET exam was announced as September 6, 2026. It was stated that if any academic inconvenience or difficulty is brought to attention, it will be verified and the final rescheduled date along with a detailed timetable will be declared in the next 15 days.

            However, as the CTET (Central Teacher Eligibility Test) is pre-scheduled on September 6, 2026, conducting both exams on the same day would prevent students from appearing in both exams. Therefore, the SET department received emails and written letters from candidates requesting a reschedule of the exam date in their interest.

